  "number": "19.1",
  "ref": "TMR1995/r19.1",
  "text": "The hours of business of the Trade Marks Office and each sub-office (if any) of the Trade Marks Office are from 9 am to 5 pm on each day other than: (a) a Saturday or a Sunday; or (b) a public holiday: (i) where the Office or sub-office (if any) is located; or (ii) for the purposes of the Australian Public Service in that place.",
